<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus repo yield falls to 4.41 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus repo yield falls to 4.41 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a repo auction held between the Cyprus central bank and commercial banks was 4.41 percent on Monday from 4.57 percent at the last auction held on March 11, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 51.3 million pounds for the 49.5 million pounds worth of bills on offer. Yields ranged from 4.20 percent to 4.76 percent, the central bank said in an announcement.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
